{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（23日）是九龍清真寺的開放日，由上午 11 時至下午四時半，公眾可免費入場參觀，無須報名。參觀者可聽可蘭經、了解阿拉伯書法、伊斯蘭書籍等。九龍清真寺是全港最大的清真寺，樓高四層，可容納逾 3000 人同行禮拜。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05443-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05490-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05427-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05569-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05813-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06139-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05406-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05938-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05891-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05857-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06414-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05423-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06461-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06553-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06152-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS05391-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DVS06294-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T10:01:03.943695+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":17,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}